sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Client as [User] Client<br/>クライアント
    participant WSGI as [I/O] Flask.__call__<br/>WSGIエントリ
    participant Ctx as [Ctx] AppContext<br/>コンテキスト
    participant Session as [Session] SessionInterface<br/>セッション
    participant Before as [Hook] before_request<br/>前処理フック
    participant Router as [Router] url_map<br/>URLルーター
    participant View as [View] View Function<br/>ビュー関数
    participant Error as [Error] handle_exception<br/>エラーハンドラ
    participant After as [Hook] after_request<br/>後処理フック
    participant Tdown as [Hook] teardown_request<br/>ティアダウン
    participant Res as [Output] Response<br/>レスポンス

    Client->>+WSGI: HTTP Request (environ, start_response)
    WSGI->>+Ctx: push() - Create AppContext
    Note right of Ctx: current_app, g, request<br/>session が利用可能に
    Ctx->>+Session: open_session() - Load Cookie
    Session-->>-Ctx: Session Data
    Ctx->>+Before: Execute before_request hooks
    Before-->>-Ctx: Continue / Short-circuit

    alt URL Matched
        Ctx->>+Router: url_map.match(path, method)
        Router-->>-Ctx: endpoint, view_args
        Ctx->>+View: view_function(**view_args)
    else URL Not Matched
        Ctx->>+Router: url_map.match() raises
        Router-->>-Error: 404/405 Exception
    end

    alt View Returns Successfully
        View-->>-Ctx: Response / Data
    else View Raises Exception
        View-->>+Error: Exception
        Error-->>-Ctx: Error Response
    end

    Ctx->>+After: Execute after_request hooks
    After-->>-Ctx: Modified Response
    Ctx->>+Session: save_session() - Set Cookie
    Session-->>-Ctx: Cookie Headers Added
    Ctx->>+Tdown: Execute teardown_request hooks
    Tdown-->>-Ctx: Cleanup Done
    Ctx->>Ctx: pop() - Destroy AppContext
    WSGI-->>-Client: HTTP Response (status, headers, body)
